### NORTE API — ejemplos (extensión REST Client de VS Code o cliente HTTP de JetBrains)
### Levanta todo con `docker compose up --build` y usa correos de prueba inventados.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = ana.prueba@example.com
@password = cambia-esta-clave-de-prueba

### Textos de consentimiento vigentes (públicos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/consent-texts

### Crear cuenta: cada finalidad se acepta por separado (o no se acepta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "consents": [
    { "purpose": "PROFILE_STORAGE", "granted": true, "textVersion": "2026-10" }
  ]
}

### Iniciar sesión
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@access = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Guardar preferencias (requiere PROFILE_STORAGE)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeCity": "Cuenca",
  "acceptsRelocation": false,
  "yearsOfExperience": 2,
  "englishLevel": "B2",
  "minSalaryUsd": 1000,
  "weights": { "demonstrated": 35, "declared": 10, "experience": 15, "location": 15, "language": 10, "compensation": 10, "freshness": 5 }
}

### Habilidades: solo identificadores del catálogo y su origen (nunca el CV)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "skillId": "java", "origin": "DEMONSTRATED", "repos": ["api-inventario"] },
  { "skillId": "docker", "origin": "DECLARED" }
]

### Guardar una vacante para seguirla
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "j_ejemplo01",
  "jobTitle": "Desarrollador Java",
  "company": "Empresa Ficticia S.A.",
  "jobUrl": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/ficticia/jobs/1",
  "followUpAt": "2026-11-10"
}

### Marcarla como postulada (queda en el historial)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "j_ejemplo01",
  "jobTitle": "Desarrollador Java",
  "company": "Empresa Ficticia S.A.",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "notes": "Envié el CV por el portal de la empresa."
}

### Mis postulaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Activar alertas (requiere EMAIL_ALERTS y PROFILE_STORAGE)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/consents/EMAIL_ALERTS
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "granted": true, "textVersion": "2026-10" }

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": true, "minScore": 70 }

### Exportar todos mis datos (acceso y portabilidad)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/export
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Rotar el token de refresco
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Borrar la cuenta de verdad (pide la contraseña)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "{{password}}" }

### Estado de la API
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
